# Generated files

*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart
*.config.dart
*.gr.dart
*.gm.dart


# `*.module.dart` (injectable's `@InjectableInit.microPackage()` output) is
# deliberately NOT ignored, even when generated files are otherwise excluded.
# It is the one generated artifact that is cross-package API rather than
# package-internal: the host app's `lib/di/injector.dart` names each package's
# `<Pkg>PackageModule` class inside `@InjectableInit(externalPackageModulesBefore:
# [ExternalModule(...)])`, and build_runner only writes `build_to: source`
# outputs for the package it is invoked in — an app-scoped
# `dart run build_runner build` (or `melos run build:app`) can never produce a
# *dependency's* `injector.module.dart`. When those files are missing the
# identifiers do not resolve, injectable's `ConstantReader.read('module')`
# returns a null constant, and the app build dies with the unactionable
# `injectable_generator:injectable_config_builder on lib/di/injector.dart:
# FormatException: Not an instance of Type.` (Archipelago-rukn).
# `template_base` commits these files for the same reason. Everything else
# above is regenerated by its own package's build and stays ignored.

